            "review_title": "Review at Edosushi",
            "review_text": "danmaio\nPerth, Australia88 contributions\n0\nVery nice food and fantastic price.\nOct 2017 • Solo\nI walked past this place a couple of times and when I looked on trip advisor, it was not listed. Anyway, went for dinner after a few beers and was happy that there were quite s few people eating there, in fact, only two tables were not being used. Unfortunately I was to hungry to ask for an English menu, and went off my limited Vietnamese and photos. Had tempura prawns and 3 different types of sushi. Prawns were delicious, and all the sushi I ordered was great fresh tasting. It was very enjoyable, and the serves were big. Still couldn't work out why it was not on TripAdvisor, hence added it. It really is worth a try and really very reasonable price, if not cheap.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 11, 2017",
